  <h1 class="t-title">Lec8. Training Part VI</h1>
  <div class="body notes">
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">Generalization / Tricks of the trade</h2>
    
    </section>
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">Training Neural Nets by Gradient Descent</h2>
    <div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-01.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-02.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
<li>L2, KL과 같은 divergence를 고를 수 있음.<br>⇒ Loss function을 고르는 느낌.
</li>
</ul>
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-03.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
