th data-c="2E" d="M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z"></path></g></g></g></svg></span>에 관해서 볼 때)
</li>
<li>→ activation이 거의 loss function의 surface를 보여줌.
</li>
</ul>
    </section>
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">A note on derivatives</h2>
    <div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-04.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
