</li>
</ul>
    </section>
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">The problem of covariate shifts</h2>
    <ul>
<li>각 minibatch가 서로 너무 많은 정보를 담고있을 수 있음
</li>
<li>모든 minibatch가 모두 다른 곳에 있을 수도 있음
</li>
</ul>
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-05.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
<li>→ 모두 <b class="k-blue">표준 위치</b>로 보낼 수 있어야 함
</li>
</ul>
<h3>Move all minibatch to a “standard” location</h3>
<div class="cols">
<div class="col" style="flex:1">
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-06.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
</div>
<div class="col" style="flex:1">
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-07.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-08.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
<li class="nn">1. 원점으로 이동
</li>
<li class="nn">2. 표준편차로 나눠서 분산을 같게 함
</li>
<li class="nn">3. 고정된 위치로 이동
</li>
</ul>
    </section>
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">Batch normalization : Training</h2>
    <div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-09.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="cols">
<div class="col" style="flex:1">
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-10.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
<li>B: minibatch size
</li>
<li><span class="mjx"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.489ex;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="2.766ex" height="1.489ex" role="img" focusable="false" viewBox="0 -442 1222.7 658"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="scale(1,-1)"><g data-mml-node="math"><g data-mml-node="msub"><g data-mml-node="mi"><path data-c="1D707" d="M58 -216Q44 -216 34 -208T23 -186Q23 -176 96 116T173 414Q186 442 219 442Q231 441 239 435T249 423T251 413Q251 401 220 279T187 142Q185 131 185 107V99Q185 26 252 26Q261 26 270 27T287 31T302 38T315 45T327 55T338 65T348 77T356 88T365 100L372 110L408 253Q444 395 448 404Q461 431 491 431Q504 431 512 424T523 412T525 402L449 84Q448 79 448 68Q448 43 455 35T476 26Q485 27 496 35Q517 55 537 131Q543 151 547 152Q549 153 557 153H561Q580 153 580 144Q580 138 575 117T555 63T523 13Q510 0 491 -8Q483 -10 467 -10Q446 -10 429 -4T402 11T385 29T376 44T374 51L368 45Q362 39 350 30T324 12T288 -4T246 -11Q199 -11 153 12L129 -85Q108 -167 104 -180T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216Z"></path></g><g data-mml-node="mi" transform="translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)"><path data-c="1D435" d="M231 637Q204 637 199 638T194 649Q194 676 205 682Q206 683 335 683Q594 683 608 681Q671 671 713 636T756 544Q756 480 698 429T565 360L555 357Q619 348 660 311T702 219Q702 146 630 78T453 1Q446 0 242 0Q42 0 39 2Q35 5 35 10Q35 17 37 24Q42 43 47 45Q51 46 62 46H68Q95 46 128 49Q142 52 147 61Q150 65 219 339T288 628Q288 635 231 637ZM649 544Q649 574 634 600T585 634Q578 636 493 637Q473 637 451 637T416 636H403Q388 635 384 626Q382 622 352 506Q352 503 351 500L320 374H401Q482 374 494 376Q554 386 601 434T649 544ZM595 229Q595 273 572 302T512 336Q506 337 429 337Q311 337 310 336Q310 334 293 263T258 122L240 52Q240 48 252 48T333 46Q422 46 429 47Q491 54 543 105T595 229Z"></path></g></g></g></g></svg></span> : Minibatch mean<br>σ : Minibatch standard deviation
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="col" style="flex:1">
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-11.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<ul>
<li>평균을 빼고,<br>표준편차로 나눔.
</li>
<li><span class="hl">⇒ “<b class="k-blue">Move all minibatch to a “standard” location” 부분이랑 같은 것을 하는 거임.(위에)</b></span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-12.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<h3>Batch Normalization : Scale &amp; Shift</h3>
<ul>
<li>ẑᵢ = γuᵢ + β
<ul>
<li><b class="k-blue">γ (Gamma)</b> : Scale → 분포의 크기 조절<br><b class="k-blue">β (Beta)</b> : Shift → 분포의 위치 이동
</li>
<li>정규화하면 평균 0, 분산 약 1로 제한됨.<br>→ γ와 β를 <b class="k-blue">학습 가능한 파라미터</b>로 설정하여 최적의 분포를 찾음.
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><span class="hl">⇒ <b class="k-blue">Batch Normalization = 정규화 + Scale &amp; Shift</b></span>
</li>
</ul>
    </section>
    <section class="part">
    <h2 class="sec-h">Batch Normalization : Gradient 계산</h2>
    <div class="figwrap"><img src="img/lec8-13.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
<h3>1. Without BN</h3>
<ul>
<li>Loss = (1/B) Σᵢ Lᵢ<br>∇Loss = (1/B) Σᵢ ∇Lᵢ
<ul>
<li>→ 각 데이터의 출력과 Gradient는 다른 데이터와 독립적임.
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>2. With BN(BatchNorm)</h3>
<ul>
<li>BN은 Mini-batch 전체의 평균(<span class="mjx"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.489ex;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="2.766ex" height="1.489ex" role="img" focusable="false" viewBox="0 -442 1222.7 658"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="scale(1,-1)"><g data-mml-node="math"><g data-mml-node="msub"><g data-mml-node="mi"><path data-c="1D707" d="M58 -216Q44 -216 34 -208T23 -186Q23 -176 96 116T173 414Q186 442 219 442Q231 441 239 435T249 423T251 413Q251 401 220 279T187 142Q185 131 185 107V99Q185 26 252 26Q261 26 270 27T287 31T302 38T315 45T327 55T338 65T348 77T356 88T365 100L372 110L408 253Q444 395 448 404Q461 431 491 431Q504 431 512 424T523 412T525 402L449 84Q448 79 448 68Q448 43 455 35T476 26Q485 27 496 35Q517 55 537 131Q543 151 547 152Q549 153 557 153H561Q580 153 580 144Q580 138 575 117T555 63T523 13Q510 0 491 -8Q483 -10 467 -10Q446 -10 429 -4T402 11T385 29T376 44T374 51L368 45Q362 39 350 30T324 12T288 -4T246 -11Q199 -11 153 12L129 -85Q108 -167 104 -180T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216Z"></path></g><g data-mml-node="mi" transform="translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)"><path data-c="1D435" d="M231 637Q204 637 199 638T194 649Q194 676 205 682Q206 683 335 683Q594 683 608 681Q671 671 713 636T756 544Q756 480 698 429T565 360L555 357Q619 348 660 311T702 219Q702 146 630 78T453 1Q446 0 242 0Q42 0 39 2Q35 5 35 10Q35 17 37 24Q42 43 47 45Q51 46 62 46H68Q95 46 128 49Q142 52 147 61Q150 65 219 339T288 628Q288 635 231 637ZM649 544Q649 574 634 600T585 634Q578 636 493 637Q473 637 451 637T416 636H403Q388 635 384 626Q382 622 352 506Q352 503 351 500L320 374H401Q482 374 494 376Q554 386 601 434T649 544ZM595 229Q595 273 572 302T512 336Q506 337 429 337Q311 337 310 336Q310 334 293 263T258 122L240 52Q240 48 252 48T333 46Q422 46 429 47Q491 54 543 105T595 229Z"></path></g></g></g></g></svg></span>)과 분산(<span class="mjx"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.452ex;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" wi